{
 "source": "trapp",
 "book": "2CH",
 "chapter": 22,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.1",
   "range": "2CH.22.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c0a836f4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.1#p1-eb0a5315",
     "text": "The Sanhedrim especially there sitting.",
     "anchor": "And the inhabitants of Jerusalem."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.1#p2-2b3fbdbc",
     "text": "Called also Azariah, {2Ch 22:6} and Jehoahaz, {2Ch 21:17} for he was trinomous.",
     "anchor": "Made Ahaziah.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ch 22:6",
       "ref": "2CH.22.6"
      },
      {
       "text": "2Ch 21:17",
       "ref": "2CH.21.17"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.1#p3-2b3169c7",
     "text": "After that they had carried them captive. {2Ch 21:17}",
     "anchor": "Had slain all the eldest.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ch 21:17",
       "ref": "2CH.21.17"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.2",
   "range": "2CH.22.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bd821a0c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.2#p1-bd821a0c",
     "text": "Heb., The son of two and forty years was Ahaziah when he began to reign; i.e., in the last of the two and forty years of the house of Omri, in which it fell, and Ahaziah with it. See on 2Ki 8:26.",
     "anchor": "Forty and two years old.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 8:26",
       "ref": "2KI.8.26"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.3",
   "range": "2CH.22.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2f4936ce",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.3#p1-2f4936ce",
     "text": "Mothers have a great influence upon their children, whether for good or evil. Catherine de Medici, queen mother of France, for instance, a second Athaliah.",
     "anchor": "For his mother was his counsellor."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.4",
   "range": "2CH.22.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3d168b2e",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.4#p1-3d168b2e",
     "text": "See 2Ki 8:27, where he is said to be the son-in-law to the house of Ahab. So that what by his mother’s command, and what by his wife’s importunity, he was utterly marred.",
     "anchor": "Wherefore he did evil.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 8:27",
       "ref": "2KI.8.27"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.5",
   "range": "2CH.22.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bc0daef3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.5#p1-bc0daef3",
     "text": "See 2Ki 8:28. He went to fetch his death.",
     "anchor": "And went with Jehoram.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 8:28",
       "ref": "2KI.8.28"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.6",
   "range": "2CH.22.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "38c287b8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.6#p1-d785306f",
     "text": "See 2Ki 9:15.",
     "anchor": "And he returned to be healed.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 9:15",
       "ref": "2KI.9.15"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.6#p2-ae7c100a",
     "text": "See on 2Ch 22:1.",
     "anchor": "And Azariah.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ch 22:1",
       "ref": "2CH.22.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.7",
   "range": "2CH.22.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9f96b49c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.7#p1-346549ac",
     "text": "Heb., The treading down, sc., with the feet of Jehu.",
     "anchor": "And the destruction."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.7#p2-434c6223",
     "text": "See 2Ki 9:21, &c.",
     "anchor": "By coming to Joram.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 9:21",
       "ref": "2KI.9.21"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.8",
   "range": "2CH.22.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "03271165",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.8#p1-de4ff665",
     "text": "2Ki 9:22, &c.",
     "anchor": "When Jehu was executing.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 9:22",
       "ref": "2KI.9.22"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.8#p2-f52396e5",
     "text": "2Ki 10:13-14.",
     "anchor": "And the sons of the brethren.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 10:13-14",
       "ref": "2KI.10.13-14"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.9",
   "range": "2CH.22.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "36ffc3c1",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.9#p1-b7cf3321",
     "text": "2Ki 9:27.",
     "anchor": "And he sought Ahaziah.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 9:27",
       "ref": "2KI.9.27"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.9#p2-2251497b",
     "text": "Because, said they, he is the son of Jehoshaphat:] Holiness hath its honour in the worst hearts. Here also Ahaziah receiveth courtesy from Jehoshaphat’s dust."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.9#p3-0da24e52",
     "text": "Either by reason of their tender age, or for want of partakers, or by reason of Athaliah’s might.",
     "anchor": "So the house of Ahaziah had no power to keep still the kingdom."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.10",
   "range": "2CH.22.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "41173a90",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.10#p1-be11095d",
     "text": "See 2Ki 11:1.",
     "anchor": "But when Athaliah.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Ki 11:1",
       "ref": "2KI.11.1"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.10#p2-a50ada4c",
     "text": "Such another wicked woman was the mother of King Edward, called the martyr, whom she basely butchered; and because his brother Ethelred, who succeeded him, being but ten years of age, mourned for him, his mother was so enraged thereat, that taking wax candles which were readiest at hand, therewith she scorched him so sore, that he could never after endure wax candles to be burnt before him. {a}",
     "anchor": "Destroyed all the seed royal."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.22.10#p3-d1c0e9cf",
     "text": "{a} Mr Clark’s Martyrol., p. 31."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.22.11-12",
   "range": "2CH.22.11-12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fbc6534c",
   "paragraphs": [
